These scripts are copied unchanged from the PRIVATE.md standard's reference implementation:
https://github.com/coreyx/private-md-standard, skills/private-md/scripts/, at commit c9516ddc00c04a6f7a0944e36796bfdd12aede8e.
They are MIT-licensed (see LICENSE). Project Docs runs `private_md.py install-hooks`, which copies
them into a repo and wires up commit hooks that block real values from PRIVATE.md.
